{"id":"2e81c8573f40b6c7","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md","title":"Strong Limit Cardinal","display":"df-strong-limit — Strong Limit Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-strong-limit","aliases":["58-df-strong-limit","58-thm-strong-limit-properties","Strong Limit Cardinal Properties","Strong Limit Theorem"],"display":"df-strong-limit — Strong Limit Cardinal","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-cardinal-exponentiation.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-cardinalexpp.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-strong-limit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-strong-limit</span><span>58-thm-strong-limit-properties</span><span>Strong Limit Cardinal Properties</span><span>Strong Limit Theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-strong-limit — Strong Limit Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e9a96ab954b6013e\" href=\"?note=e9a96ab954b6013e\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-cardinal-exponentiation.md\">../batch09/58-df-cardinal-exponentiation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"949691fe1747f59d\" href=\"?note=949691fe1747f59d\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-cardinalexpp.md\">../batch14/58-df-cardinalexpp.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CardExp}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CardExp}_S\\)</span> (cardinal-exponentiation function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e9a96ab954b6013e\" href=\"?note=e9a96ab954b6013e\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-cardinal-exponentiation.md\">../batch09/58-df-cardinal-exponentiation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (strong-limit-cardinal predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strong\\text{-}limit} \\vdash \\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\to\\mathrm{CardExp}_S(2,\\lambda)&lt;\\kappa\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strong\\text{-}limit} \\vdash \\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\to\\mathrm{CardExp}_S(2,\\lambda)&lt;\\kappa\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>58-thm-strong-limit-properties</code> is merged here because its Assertion repeated this definition.</li>\n<li>The power of two uses the actual upstream base/exponent signature.</li>\n<li>Strong limit cardinals dominate all smaller power sets and all smaller beth values.</li>\n<li>Inaccessible cardinals are exactly the regular strong limit cardinals above <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The first common singular strong-limit example is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beth_\\omega\">\\(\\beth_\\omega\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-cardinal-exponentiation.md","status":"resolved","id":"e9a96ab954b6013e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-cardinal-exponentiation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-cardinalexpp.md","status":"resolved","id":"949691fe1747f59d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-cardinalexpp.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-cardinal-exponentiation.md","status":"resolved","id":"e9a96ab954b6013e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CardExp}_S$ (cardinal-exponentiation function, see [[../batch09/58-df-cardinal-exponentiation.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CardExp}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strong\\text{-}limit} \\vdash \\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda<\\kappa\\to\\mathrm{CardExp}_S(2,\\lambda)<\\kappa\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\beth_\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1466,"backlinks":[{"id":"0e101aa2666228ea","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md]])"},{"id":"f1490c9f323a355a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S$（强极限谓词，见 [[../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md]]）"},{"id":"a285ddc9423fd5f8","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"06ee5d7ff126e916","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S,\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S,\\mathrm{LimitCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]], [[../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md]], [[../batch14/58-df-zfc-limit-cardinal.md]])"},{"id":"d864c52e84a3bb62","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7e31cded0d7f3d54","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S$ (canonical strong-limit predicate, see [[58-df-strong-limit]])"},{"id":"e9f730d467a652fc","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S$ (strong-limit-cardinal predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md]])"},{"id":"b7dd94f2e654aefb","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StrongLimit}_S$（强极限基数谓词，见 [[../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md]]）"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-205","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-strong-limit]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1237","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-strong-limit.md|58-df-strong-limit]]（batch13）